{"unit_id":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe__DSH-Workshop#readme-1","repo":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe/DSH-Workshop","commit":"056121599cd0775eedd215e85d9b34c3f9385ba0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"harness-workshop README · Harness 创意工坊：为 DeepSeek Harness 打造的插件市场：复刻 Steam 创意工坊的浏览、筛选、订阅与安装体验，管理和分发 Harness 扩展功能（主题、效率工具、Agent 预设、教程等）。","source":"extracted","section":"Harness 创意工坊"}
{"unit_id":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe__DSH-Workshop#readme-2","repo":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe/DSH-Workshop","commit":"056121599cd0775eedd215e85d9b34c3f9385ba0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"harness-workshop README · 功能：- **浏览与检索**：综合热度/订阅数/更新时间/评分/浏览量五种排序，全局搜索，分类树 + 标签过滤\n- **订阅管理**：订阅状态本地持久化，卡片/统计/徽章实时联动\n- **真实安装**：在 DSH web 内订阅即自动安装——host 下载校验 → 写入 profile 依赖与 patch 行 → `pnpm install`，刷新页面生效；取消订阅自动卸载\n- **GitHub 实时同步**：每 6 小时自动扫描 `topic:dsh-plugin` 新仓库并入列，打开工坊即拉取最新（缓存过期自动刷新，也可手动 `POST /api/harness-workshop/refresh`）\n- **详情页**：简介、更新日志、评论、GitHub 源码入口\n- **零依赖**：纯 HTML/CSS/JS，双击 `index.html` 即可离线运行","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe__DSH-Workshop#readme-3","repo":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe/DSH-Workshop","commit":"056121599cd0775eedd215e85d9b34c3f9385ba0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"harness-workshop README · 安装到 DSH：1. 构建客户端 bundle：`npm run build`\n2. 在 web profile（`$DSH_HOME/profiles/web`）的 `package.json` 添加依赖：\n\n```json\n   \"harness-workshop\": \"link:本仓库路径\"\n   ```\n\n3. 在 `cordis.patch.yml` 追加一行：\n\n```yaml\n   - insert:\n       - id: harness-workshop\n         name: harness-workshop\n   ```\n\n4. 在 profile 目录执行 `pnpm install`，重启 DSH web（或等待 patch 热重组合），刷新页面后侧边栏底部出现「创意工坊」入口\n\n> 独立运行预览：`npm run serve`，浏览器打开 http://127.0.0.1:8357","source":"extracted","section":"安装到 DSH"}
{"unit_id":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe__DSH-Workshop#readme-4","repo":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe/DSH-Workshop","commit":"056121599cd0775eedd215e85d9b34c3f9385ba0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"harness-workshop README · 数据来源：条目来自 GitHub `topic:dsh-plugin` 真实仓库，seed 数据在 `mock-data/workshop_items.json`。手动刷新：\n\n```bash\nnpm run fetch      # 从 GitHub 拉取最新仓库数据（合并入 mock-data）\nnpm run refresh    # fetch + 重建封面/数据/bundle\n```","source":"extracted","section":"数据来源"}
{"unit_id":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe__DSH-Workshop#readme-5","repo":"AAA-STM32XinPianPiFaWangGe/DSH-Workshop","commit":"056121599cd0775eedd215e85d9b34c3f9385ba0","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"harness-workshop README · 开发：```bash\nnpm run serve     # 本地预览（http://127.0.0.1:8357）\nnpm run build     # 重建封面、内嵌数据与 DSH 客户端 bundle\nnpm test          # DOM 冒烟测试（需先 serve）\n```","source":"extracted","section":"开发"}
